"from the stone age" "brilliant and eloquant politician" "a dog" "a camel" "a shark" "an eagle" "a dominant lion" "jean delafontaine" "a video game developer" "a serbian army general" "Joseph Stalin" "Lenin" "a trotskist" "a bolchevik" "an astronaute" "a very old mamoth" "a siberian political prisonner" "a gladiator" "the first human living on mars" "a professor or law" "a professeor of medecine" "a medical doctor" "a japanese soldier during WWI" "a papa poule" "a magician")

